# Live trading defaults to OFF. Keep credentials in a separate mode-0600
# .live.env file. Arming requires the exact confirmation phrase. A positive
# timestamp adds an optional expiry; zero means no time limit. Ambiguous or
# unresolved orders block duplicate risk.
